# Browsers the build targets.
#
# This deliberately matches the browsers Angular itself supports rather than a
# broad "> 0.5%, last 2 versions" query. The previous query resolved to 33
# targets including op_mini, kaios and and_qq, none of which Angular 22 supports.
# The old webpack builder ignored them with a warning; the esbuild builder
# honours them and downlevels output to ES5, which breaks bootstrapping with
# "Class constructor cannot be invoked without 'new'" when downlevelled classes
# extend native ones.
#
# See https://angular.dev/reference/versions#browser-support
last 2 Chrome versions
last 2 Edge major versions
last 2 Firefox versions
Firefox ESR
